+    "Looking at the form of the long-range density in the left panel of the above plot, it is a periodic, smoothly oscillating function so any solution is likely to involve trigonometric functions somehow.  Returning to the discussion at the top of the notebook, we remember that the potential comes from solving the Poisson equation:\n",
